  "complete_lifecycle_observations": [
    "Capture goal chooses a valid nearby sacrifice and requests startRiding without checking its boolean. Native carrying sync is refreshed from passenger presence after super.tick; hurt does not immediately update that field.",
    "Follower goal seeks ring offsets and sets PRAYING near the offset. Carrier at its center advances its own WORSHIP_TIME; prior value >200, cloudCooldown<=0 and >=3 linked follower praying flags admit triggerSacrificeIn(300), consume cloudCooldown400 and broadcast62.",
    "Quorum is a linked-pack flag count, not direct current-position/alive checks; the follower out-of-position branch resets worship time without clearing praying. Do not describe continuous live geometric ring enforcement or human/network-player quorum.",
    "Carrier hurt calls super.hurt first; only true plus isVehicle plus random<.65 ejects. Goal stop resets worship/praying/particle state, ejects and may set cooldown100. Neither entry clears victim armed fields and the sacrifice interface has no cancellation method.",
    "Gloomoth decrements armed timer on server without a passenger condition; at <0 it requests Watcher conversion even after dismount. Current Underzealot vehicle is required only for postSacrifice/idleDig side effects.",
    "Vesper decrements armed timer only while any passenger relation exists on server. Dismount pauses, does not clear the armed flag; a later vehicle may resume. At expiry it requests Forsaken conversion, with current Underzealot requirement only on carrier postSacrifice/idleDig.",
    "Conversion requests and subsequent non-null branches are source observations, not guarantees of successful world insertion/conversion, HP change, advancement receipt or runtime behavior.",
    "Event77 requests chant. Type5 sound lookup uses integer ID and held entity alive/ID identity; queue admission checks canPlaySound plus queued/ticking lists. Sound canPlay checks !silent/praying/worship<MAX, while its own running tick stops on !alive or !praying, not on MAX/silent changes. Cache removal only removes a map entry, not an explicit sound-manager stop.",
    "Renderer burrow gate and model setupAnim carrying/praying interpolation provide state presentation only. Underzealot isInvulnerableTo adds IN_WALL to super; buried pick/push/attackability filters are not universal hurt refusal."
  ],
  "required_wording_limits": [
    "Multi-actor means NPC pack members, not player multiplayer coordination.",
    "Use dismount/unseat, not chunk unload. Armed/timer fields are local runtime fields; searched complete victim files show their declaration, tick and trigger writes only, with no explicit save/load or cancel reset. No unload/reload persistence or ticking while unloaded is claimed.",
    "Committed means the trigger has armed a future runtime attempt; it does not mean irreversible, durable, guaranteed conversion or exactly-once settlement.",
    "No ongoing geometric quorum guarantee; stale praying flags are possible in the shown branch until another path clears them.",
    "isValidSacrificePos loops i=-2..-2 and j=-2..-2; this does not validate a complete 5x5 floor. Do not generalize comments/intent to stronger actual admission.",
    "No live audio, pixel rendering, packet transport, native engine internals, cross-mod composition or gameplay acceptance was tested."
  ],
